{"3902050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fourth Dimension", "steam_appid": 3902050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902050/extras/880aeec65aabea7a8bbdfa74b5678373.poster.avif?t=1782393765\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902050/extras/880aeec65aabea7a8bbdfa74b5678373.webm?t=1782393765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902050/extras/880aeec65aabea7a8bbdfa74b5678373.mp4?t=1782393765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Fourth Dimension is an atmospheric psychological thriller and parkour experience where you journey through the dark corners of your subconscious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll find yourself in a dimension where nothing is as it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome parkour challenges, follow the story, and feel the rising tension with every step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each step forward pulls you deeper into the unknown, leaving you no choice but to face your fears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902050/extras/a8df4c40345d876ec1c8c1a8f3d363a5.poster.avif?t=1782393765\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902050/extras/a8df4c40345d876ec1c8c1a8f3d363a5.webm?t=1782393765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can be the first to know about updates and new content by following our social media pages!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902050/extras/38b93e682888dba9235339a6b249ea9d.poster.avif?t=1782393765\" width=400 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902050/extras/38b93e682888dba9235339a6b249ea9d.webm?t=1782393765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone in the depths of the graveyard.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amidst forgotten graves cloaked in mist, there is something… watching you, gazing at you — a presence from the past. This spiritual entity is the echo of a dark curse from centuries ago, born from souls that could never rest beyond the veil of mortality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can hear its whispers only in the silence of the night, when your heart slows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even when the wind ceases, something echoes in your ear. Whispers of a name... Shadows stir. The darkness closes in around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one knows why it is there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some say it is the spirit of one who was cursed for betrayal. Others believe it is the reliving of a tragedy that repeats every night at the same hour. But those are only rumors...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But one thing is certain: there is no escape from its wrath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its presence does more than watch; it constricts around you and seizes you. In your most vulnerable moment, it reveals your deepest fears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you sense it… it may already be too late.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902050/extras/02dabffbaee15efd30aec165c08abfbc.poster.avif?t=1782393765\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902050/extras/02dabffbaee15efd30aec165c08abfbc.webm?t=1782393765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902050/extras/02dabffbaee15efd30aec165c08abfbc.mp4?t=1782393765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The door is ajar. Do you have the courage to step inside?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902050/extras/6b89fbcb4f9a26a263a3158ccc68196a.avif?t=1782393765\" width=616 height=250 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spirits</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Shadow Entities / Shadow Beings  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suspense / Thriller  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Graveyard / Cemetery  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abandoned Hospital  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more...</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902050/extras/880aeec65aabea7a8bbdfa74b5678373.poster.avif?t=1782393765\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902050/extras/880aeec65aabea7a8bbdfa74b5678373.webm?t=1782393765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902050/extras/880aeec65aabea7a8bbdfa74b5678373.mp4?t=1782393765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Fourth Dimension is an atmospheric psychological thriller and parkour experience where you journey through the dark corners of your subconscious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll find yourself in a dimension where nothing is as it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome parkour challenges, follow the story, and feel the rising tension with every step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each step forward pulls you deeper into the unknown, leaving you no choice but to face your fears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902050/extras/a8df4c40345d876ec1c8c1a8f3d363a5.poster.avif?t=1782393765\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902050/extras/a8df4c40345d876ec1c8c1a8f3d363a5.webm?t=1782393765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can be the first to know about updates and new content by following our social media pages!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902050/extras/38b93e682888dba9235339a6b249ea9d.poster.avif?t=1782393765\" width=400 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902050/extras/38b93e682888dba9235339a6b249ea9d.webm?t=1782393765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone in the depths of the graveyard.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amidst forgotten graves cloaked in mist, there is something… watching you, gazing at you — a presence from the past. This spiritual entity is the echo of a dark curse from centuries ago, born from souls that could never rest beyond the veil of mortality.</p><p cla